& [ConfirmedCommandPlan: P6SurfaceImplementation] is the command and verification plan for future implementation slices
  + [baseline_compile_command] is python -m compileall -q src tests
  + [baseline_test_command] is python -m unittest discover -s tests
  + [targeted_contract_test_after_creation] is python -m unittest tests.test_p6_surface_implementation_contracts
  + [targeted_existing_contract_test] is python -m unittest tests.test_p5_runtime_implementation_contracts
  + [targeted_existing_contract_test] is python -m unittest tests.test_p8_fixture_material_contracts
  + [targeted_existing_contract_test] is python -m unittest tests.test_ir8_integrated_manager_contracts
  + [targeted_existing_contract_test] is python -m unittest tests.test_ir7_operations_dry_run_contracts
  + [diff_hygiene_command] is git diff --check
  + [generated_projection_review] is prove generated projections and reports are ignored, disposable, reproducible, and non-authoritative
  + [no_assignment_review] is prove projection outputs remain display, request, handoff, or refusal evidence, not assignment effects
  + [no_dispatch_review] is prove projection outputs remain display, request, handoff, or refusal evidence, not dispatch effects
  + [no_operations_control_review] is prove projection outputs do not operate commands, processes, GPUs, model runtimes, jobs, credentials, network state, platform mailboxes, or destructive filesystem targets
  + [no_live_effect_review] is prove source docs, canonical specs, fixture sources, expected ledgers, proof ledgers, coordination records, operations records, and live machine state are not mutated by P6 proof code or tests

  = must: run baseline tests and diff hygiene after every future slice
  = should: run compile check after code slices begin
  = must: run targeted P6 contract tests once tests.test_p6_surface_implementation_contracts exists

